#. i18n: file: ktorrent/advancedpref.ui:275
#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QComboBox, kcfg_fullDiskPreallocMethod)
#: rc.cpp:1151
msgid ""
"<html><head><meta name=\"qrichtext\" content=\"1\" /><style type=\"text/css"
